<section id="travel" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-cream py-20 md:py-28">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 md:px-8">
		<h2 class="text-center font-serif text-3xl text-plum md:text-4xl">Travel & stay</h2>
		<div class="mx-auto mt-4 h-px w-24 bg-mauve/60" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-brown-soft">
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-mauve/15 bg-white/70 p-6">
				<h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-plum">Airports</h3>
				<p class="mt-2">
					Hollywood Burbank (BUR) and LAX are the most common options — about 35–60 minutes by car to
					Valencia depending on traffic. Ontario (ONT) is also reachable for regional guests.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-mauve/15 bg-white/70 p-6">
				<h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-plum">Hotels</h3>
				<p class="mt-2">
					A room block is reserved at a <strong class="font-medium text-plum">placeholder hotel in Valencia</strong>{' '}
					under <em>Ellis–Chen Wedding</em> through August 15. Santa Clarita and Canyon Country also offer
					additional stays a short drive from the venue.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-mauve/15 bg-white/70 p-6">
				<h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-plum">Shuttle</h3>
				<p class="mt-2">
					A complimentary shuttle will run between the hotel block and Tesoro Adobe Historic Park on the
					wedding day. Times will be emailed closer to the date.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
